title: "Where Hermes Agent surprises its operators: seven reproducible behaviors (hermes-agent-casebook)"
abstract: Seven behaviors of Hermes Agent that surprise operators, each stated as a falsifiable hypothesis and tested by a script that CI runs against official images pinned by digest, with the run transcripts committed. Written as a thesis. Independent; not affiliated with Nous Research.
